with the resulting change in n_e stated as a FACTOR so it is comparable
to the 784x directly.

--- B1  the unbounded growth branch: no wall, fixed integration time ---
This is the regime the 784x was measured in: nothing stops the growth, so
n_e at a fixed time is an exponential of a rate that depends on Te.
